<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="A structured Piano Second Opinion from pianist and teacher Hanford Lam."><title>Piano Second Opinion · Hanford Lam</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=Rye&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/second-opinion.css?v=1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/public-nav.css?v=1"></head><body>
<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/">The Learning Studio</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/#freeShelf">Free resources</a><a href="/reports">Student portal</a></nav></header>
<main><section class="service-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A thoughtful second pair of ears</p><h1>Piano Second Opinion</h1><p class="lead">Send one performance and receive a focused, practical path forward.</p><div class="facts"><span><strong>$150</strong> AUD</span><span><strong>10 minutes</strong> maximum</span><span><strong>One week</strong> after payment</span></div><a class="button" href="#submit">Send a recording</a></div></section>
<section class="service-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">What comes back</p><h2>More than a verdict</h2><p>Your playing is considered through four useful lenses, followed by concrete work for the next stage.</p></div><div class="review-map"><article><b>1</b><h3>Pulse</h3><p>Rhythmic steadiness, flow and the life of the beat.</p></article><article><b>2</b><h3>Pitch</h3><p>Accuracy, voicing and clarity in the musical texture.</p></article><article><b>3</b><h3>Articulation</h3><p>Touch, connection, release and character.</p></article><article><b>4</b><h3>Dynamics</h3><p>Shape, contrast and control of musical direction.</p></article></div><div class="return-note"><strong>You will also receive</strong><span>Suggested next tasks for improvement</span><span>General comments tying the performance together</span></div></section>
<section class="submission" id="submit"><div class="submission-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Send your performance</p><h2>Place it on the listening desk</h2><p>Attach one audio or video recording and, if useful, a score. Your recording is private and automatically deleted 30 days after submission.</p><p class="privacy-note">Accepted recording formats: MP3, M4A, WAV, AAC, OGG, MP4 and MOV. Maximum 50 MB.</p></div><form action="/piano-second-opinion" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-wait-form><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><% errors.forEach(function(message){ %><div class="notice error"><%= message %></div><% }) %><% messages.forEach(function(message){ %><div class="notice success"><%= message %></div><% }) %><label>Your name<input name="name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" required></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="160" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Piece and composer<input name="piece" maxlength="160" required></label><label>What would you most like help with?<textarea name="question" maxlength="2500" rows="5" required></textarea></label><label class="file-field">Recording<input name="recording" type="file" accept="audio/mpeg,audio/mp4,audio/x-m4a,audio/wav,audio/x-wav,audio/aac,audio/ogg,video/mp4,video/quicktime" required><small>One recording, up to 10 minutes and 50 MB.</small></label><label class="file-field">Score <span>(optional)</span><input name="score" type="file" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><small>PDF or image, up to 10 MB.</small></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="withinLength" value="yes" required><span>I confirm the recording is no longer than 10 minutes.</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>I consent to private storage of these files for up to 30 days.</span></label><div class="payment"><strong>Payment by bank transfer</strong><span>Your unique reference and payment instructions will be emailed after submission.</span></div><button class="button" type="submit" data-wait-label="Uploading…">Submit recording</button></form></section></main>
<footer><span>Hanford Lam · Boronia, Victoria</span><a href="/">Return to the studio</a></footer><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-wait-form]').forEach(function(form){form.addEventListener('submit',function(){if(!form.checkValidity())return;var button=form.querySelector('button[type=submit]');button.disabled=true;button.textContent=button.dataset.waitLabel||'Please wait…'})})</script></body></html>
